    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎲᏭ Biometric ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎢ ᏴᎬᏗ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎠᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏕᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ , ᎾᏊ ᎧᎵ ᎠᏍᎪᎸᏛᎢ ᏔᎵ ᎢᏯᏔᏬᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎦᎶᏒᎢ ᏅᎬᏗᏍᎬᎾ ᏱᎩ. 
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\RetailDemoWelcomePageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵ ᎬᏂᏙᏗ ᏦᎵᎦ ᎩᎶᎪᏫᏓ ᎬᏂᏗᎲ ᏣᎧᏛ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏰᏌᏛ ᎤᏙᎮᎸ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\RetailDemoNamePageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏙ ᏕᏣᏙᎡᏍᏗ?
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\RetailCleanupPageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎦᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎭ! ᎭᏚᏆᎸᏕᏍᏓ. 
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\PinRequiredPageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎰᏢᎾ PIN ᎬᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎪᏟᏍᏗ Ꮭ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅ. ᏂᎯ ᏱᏨᏅᏙᏗ ᏱᎩ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᏴᏅᏓ Ꮎ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎪᏢᏅᏗ ᏱᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\PinRequiredPageBodyTwo\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᎾᎯᏳ ᏱᏣᎧᏂ PIN, ᏂᎯ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏣᏁᏟᏴᏍᏓ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎧᏛ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ Windows Hello, ᎠᎴ ᏃᎴ ᏏᏊ ᎯᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎩ ᏫᏣᎶᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏗᎦᎪᏗᎢ ᏏᏊ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionDuplicateTemplate\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Hello ᎣᏍᏓ ᎦᏳᎳ ᏂᏕᎲᎦ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏓ ᏐᎢᏗᏝ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ. ᎠᎲᏍᏗ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎪᎵᏨᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏐᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎿᏉ ᏏᏊ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionCameraAccessConflict\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏓ ᏃᏊᎨᏒ ᎬᏗ Ꮎ ᏐᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ. ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ Ꮎ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionBadOrMissingHardware\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᏄᎸᎲᎦ ᎤᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗᎢ. ᎧᎵᏬᎯ ᏣᏂᏖᏍᏗ ᏚᏳᎪᏛᎢ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎭ. 
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏆᏕᎠᏔᏁᎭ, ᎪᎲᏍᏗ ᎦᎵᏍᏔᏁᏓ
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CompletePageRepeatInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏍᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ: ᏱᏛᏣᎦᏘᏅᏕ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎯᎧᎲᏍᎬ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎪᏟᏍᏗ, ᎭᏑᏰᎦ ᏓᏤᏢ ᏗᎪᎵᏗ ᏫᎷᎩ ᎥᎿ ᎦᎪᏗ ᏏᏊ ᏚᎵᎪᏒᎾ. ᎯᎠ ᏲᎩᏍᏕᎳ ᎤᏦᎵᏗᎢ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏴᎢ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CompletePageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏛᏅᏍᏓ!
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CompletePageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎯ ᏣᎧᏛᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏔᎵᏁᎢ ᏣᏚᎵᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏍᏚᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CameraPreview\AutomationProperties\Name:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎡᎲᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᎾᏓᏴᎳᏗᏍᎬ 
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceUnlockApplicationText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Hello 
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceTooManyFacesText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏂᎪᏗ ᏏᏅ ᏌᏊᎢ ᎨᏒ ᎤᎧᏛᎢ ᎠᏩᏔ. ᎠᏏᏴᏫ ᏱᎦᎶᎯ ᎠᎭᏂ ᏥᏒᏍᏗ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceNotDetectedText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏙᏳᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏣᎧᏛᎢ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎦᏙᏗᎢ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceMoveForwardText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᎥᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᎢᎷᎦ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceMoveBackwardText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎲᎾ ᎢᏍᎩᏍᏕᎵ ᎢᏴᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceGuidanceStartText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎦᏩᎢᏒᏋ ᎠᏘᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᎢᎬᏱᏗᏢ, ᎤᎧᏛ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorTooFarText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏅᎯᎢ! ᎾᎥᏂᎨᏍᏗ ᎯᎸᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorTooDarkText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏙᏳ ᎤᎵᏏᎩ! ᏘᏨᏍᏛᎦ ᏗᏨᏍᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎭᏓᏅᎾ ᏄᏓᎴᏍᏛᏗᏨ ᎤᏍᎪᏍᏗ ᎨᏒᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorTooCloseText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᎥᏂᏱ! ᏫᏟᏗᏟ ᏫᎸᎩ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorTooBrightText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᎪᏓ ᎤᏥᏍᏓᎷᎩ! ᏘᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏓᏨᏍᏛᎢ ᎠᎴᏱ ᎦᎵᏦᏕ ᏫᏴᎯ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorPoorQualityText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ Ꮭ ᏗᎪᎷᏩᏛᏓ ᏱᎩ. ᏙᏳᎢ ᎨᏒᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᎨᏗ ᎦᏘᏅᏛ ᎤᏓᏅᎦᎸᏓ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceErrorFaceOccludedText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: We’re having trouble seeing you. Try removing anything that may be blocking your face.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceEnrollCompleteText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᏍᏓ ᎾᏛᎦ! ᏂᎯ ᏃᏊ ᏓᏛᏅᎢᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬ Windows Hello!
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceDetectingErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᎩᏄᎸᎲᎦ ᎠᏕᎶᎰᏒ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎧᏛ, ᏙᎯᏳ ᏣᏅᏖᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᎦᎢ ᎢᎦᎯ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎧᏛ ᎠᏰᏟ ᎾᎿ ᏥᎩ ᎦᎸᏙᏗ.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\FaceCapturingText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎬᏫᏍᏕᏍᏗ ᏫᏣᎪᏛ ᏥᏳᎪᏓ ᎾᎿ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ
  \BioEnrollmentUI\DoneButtonText:
